    - rid: 4304780615459536950
      type: {class: LineNode, ns: CRPG.Dialogue, asm: CRPG.Dialogue}
      data:
        nodeId: intro
        editorPosition: {x: 844, y: -32}
        speakerName: You
        text: Smoke thickens the air of the deepest chamber. Crude cages of bone and wood line the walls. Goblin stalkers circle a robed Witch Doctor muttering over a huddled captive -- Elian.
        nextNodeId: check
    - rid: 4304780615459536951
      type: {class: CheckNode, ns: CRPG.Dialogue, asm: CRPG.Dialogue}
      data:
        nodeId: check
        editorPosition: {x: 858, y: -47}
        queryKey: Skill:Persuasion
        difficultyClass: 15
        performer: 1
        successNodeId: success-line
        failureNodeId: failure-line
    - rid: 4304780615459536952
      type: {class: LineNode, ns: CRPG.Dialogue, asm: CRPG.Dialogue}
      data:
        nodeId: success-line
        editorPosition: {x: 461, y: -417}
        speakerName: You
        text: Your bold defiance rattles the stalkers -- they scatter into the dark, and the Witch Doctor flees rather than face you alone. You cut Elian free. He is shaken, but alive.
        nextNodeId: alive-action
    - rid: 4304780615459536953
      type: {class: ActionNode, ns: CRPG.Dialogue, asm: CRPG.Dialogue}
      data:
        nodeId: alive-action
        editorPosition: {x: 730, y: -206}
        action:
          rid: 4304780615459536959
        nextNodeId: fate-action
    - rid: 4304780615459536954
      type: {class: LineNode, ns: CRPG.Dialogue, asm: CRPG.Dialogue}
      data:
        nodeId: failure-line
        editorPosition: {x: 402, y: 336}
        speakerName: You
        text: The stalkers close in before you can act. By the time you fight clear to the cage, Elian is already gone. You find only his mother's locket among the ashes.
        nextNodeId: dead-action
    - rid: 4304780615459536955
      type: {class: ActionNode, ns: CRPG.Dialogue, asm: CRPG.Dialogue}
